@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : ask to "Create a Map with size and name"
    activate System

        System --> Employee : Ask the name
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : Gives name
    activate System

    System --> Employee :ask if he want to use predefined sizes or custom sizes

    deactivate System
    alt custom Size
Employee->System:select custom Size
activate System
System --> Employee : Ask width, and height
deactivate System
Employee -> System : Gives width, height
activate System
System-->Employee:show data and ask for a confirmation
deactivate System
     Employee -> System : confirms map creation
     activate System

     System --> Employee : displays operation success
     deactivate System
else predefined Size


Employee->System:select predefined Size
activate System
System-->Employee:show list of Sizes and ask to select one
deactivate System
Employee->System:select one size
activate System
 System-->Employee:show data and ask for a confirmation
deactivate System
   Employee -> System : confirms map creation
     activate System

     System --> Employee : displays operation success
     deactivate System

end



@enduml
